--============================================================
-- DEXI SCRIPT V2
--============================================================
-- Dashboard fix:
-- * Overview starts with valid values instead of temporary placeholders.
-- * GetPing is defined before the first info refresh.
-- * Active Features scans a single feature registry and therefore
--   reflects every current ON toggle rather than only a short list.
-- * Dashboard refresh calls are protected so one optional subsystem
--   cannot stop all of the information panels.
--
-- Toggle polish:
-- * Every toggle has a dedicated keybind button.
-- * Default keybinds are shown directly on the toggle row.
-- * Clicking the small key box enters key-capture mode.
-- * Escape cancels capture.
-- * Backspace clears the keybind.
-- * ON transitions tween into purple.
-- * OFF transitions tween back to the dark neutral card.
--============================================================

--============================================================
-- DEXI SCRIPT V2.1 UI POLISH
--============================================================
-- Every Toggle row has a dedicated keybind control.
-- ON state uses a smooth purple tween.
-- OFF state returns to the dark neutral card.
-- Key capture: click the key box, press a key, Escape cancels,
-- Backspace clears the keybind.
-- Overview and dashboard data are populated immediately.
-- Active Features is grouped into readable rows.
--============================================================

--============================================================
-- OPEN KEY FIX
--============================================================
-- The Open/Panic key editors now use CapturingGlobalKeybind.
-- Their assigned key is consumed by the global InputBegan handler
-- before OpenKey/PanicKey actions are evaluated.
-- This prevents selecting a new Open Key from immediately opening
-- or closing the panel because the same key event is being reused.
-- Escape cancels a key capture.
--============================================================

--============================================================
-- DEXI SCRIPT - ALL FEATURE KEYBINDS UNBOUND
--============================================================
-- Every feature/toggle starts with NO keybind.
-- Feature rows therefore display "-" until the user assigns one.
--
-- Global GUI controls (Open Key / Panic Key) remain separate so
-- the panel can still be controlled. They can be customized in
-- Settings. Feature shortcuts never receive defaults.
--============================================================
